{
 "_about": "Shared cases for the #1689 quality rule (utils/sitemaps.py). A record that is not indexable gets <meta name=robots content=noindex> on openalex.org (track seo-content) AND stays out of sitemaps (track sitemaps). Records are API-shaped (what the website renders). Delta rows are derived: has_abstract = abstract_inverted_index is not null. Any implementation of the rule (Python, SQL, the website's JS) must pass every case.",
